STYLE MOTIFS SOURCED FROM THE AESTHETICS WIKI
---------------------------------------------
136 of the styles take their motif / palette / mood descriptions from
articles on aesthetics.fandom.com (text available under CC BY-SA); this
library reproduces those descriptive fragments with attribution. When reusing
those specific entries, credit the Aesthetics Wiki as well.

SAMPLE IMAGES
-------------
Sample images were generated with Google Vertex AI (gemini-2.5-flash-image) from
a single fixed subject. They are synthetic outputs, not photographs of any real
person or place.
